# Multi-cycle division under instruction fetch pressure: 20/3 = 6. Exercises the iterative
# divide stall interacting with prefetch (a classic desync spot on the main line).
@name div-normal-20-3
@verifies funcNonRestoringAlgorithm funcSignCorrection
@maxcycles 4000
li x5, 20
li x6, 3
div x7, x5, x6
check x7 == 6
